{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1RhYiUyMEh1bnRlciUyMENvbmZpZGVudGlhbCUyMCUyODIwMTUlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Tab Hunter Confidential","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/cxW0ZWf3YBBPshn2XguUsD5ZonF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qvbYCarP35cK1a50lPXnguBNkyT.jpg","description":"Throughout the 1950s, Tab Hunter reigned as Hollywood’s ultimate male heartthrob. But throughout his years of stardom, Tab had a secret. Tab Hunter was gay, and spent his Hollywood years in a precarious closet that repeatedly threatened to implode and destroy him. Tab Hunter himself shares first hand, for the first time, what it was like to be a studio manufactured movie star during the Golden Age of Hollywood and the consequences of being someone totally different from his studio manufactured image.\n\nReleased 15 Mar 2015 · United States of America · Language: English · 91 min\nStudio: Automat Pictures, Allan Glaser Productions\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.2","imdb_id":"tt1533089","moviedb_id":324314,"tmdbId":324314,"runtime":"91 min","cast":["Tab Hunter","Debbie Reynolds","Robert Wagner","John Waters","George Takei","Clint Eastwood","Portia de Rossi","Noah Wyle"],"director":["Jeffrey Schwarz"],"released":"2015-03-15T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Hollywood's all-American boy had a secret.","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jeffrey Schwarz","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kKYqisw3DtHrMHkLPNwjZrZJ2xE.jpg"},{"name":"Tab Hunter","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/Al7g54L0UWHB4l3eCmeaEnUqreC.jpg"},{"name":"Debbie Reynolds","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9Z9DQqNztKlinANGGgD5dQODtlr.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Wagner","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dgIN3MrOfX8Q4pzchO58dhMgr